// Hireable staff archetypes and name pools.
// Keys: staff.<id>.role / .bio / .likes / .dislikes. Wage = CZK per night (8 h).
// In Story mode the archetype *is* the story person (story_name). Names are never translated.
// Hands-on: default_duty = the duty the hire card proposes; prefs = the rozpis puzzle chips
// (quotes: staff.<id>.pref.<n>). handson.md moves the first hire to night 3 — pending T4 (the sim QA
// tests still hire on night 2); story.ron already shows the hire hints on night 3.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
